anel\">\n    <summary class=\"reality-summary\">\n      <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"panel-icon\">👤</span><span class=\"panel-title\">主角信息</span></span>\n      <span class=\"arrow-indicator text-gray-500 font-mono\">▶</span>\n    </summary>\n    <div class=\"reality-body\">\n      • <strong>姓名/身份：</strong>文骏（25岁 / 中型互联公司居家程序员）<br>\n      • <strong>支配力指数：</strong>Lv.1 新晋宿主<br>\n      • <strong>拥有特权：</strong>绝对记忆豁免（全宇宙唯一保留修改前记忆者）\n    </div>\n  </details>\n\n  <details class=\"reality-panel\">\n    <summary class=\"reality-summary\">\n      <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"panel-icon\">💋</span><span class=\"panel-title\">后宫名册 (0人)</span></span>\n      <span class=\"arrow-indicator text-gray-500 font-mono\">▶</span>\n    </summary>\n    <div class=\"reality-body text-gray-400 italic\">\n      暂无已攻略目标。快去使用修改器打造属于你的专属都市后宫吧！\n    </div>\n  </details>\n\n  <details class=\"reality-panel\" open>\n    <summary class=\"reality-summary text-sky-400\">\n      <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"panel-icon\">👗</span><span class=\"panel-title\">当前场景NPC</span></span>\n      <span class=\"arrow-indicator text-sky-400 font-mono\">▼</span>\n    </summary>\n    <div class=\"reality-body space-y-1 text-gray-300\">\n      <div><strong>姓名：</strong>苏婉清</div>\n      <div><strong>年龄/性别：</strong>24 / 女</div>\n      <div><strong>身份：</strong>对门邻居，自由插画师</div>\n      <div><strong>性格：</strong>外冷内热、艺术气质、轻微宅、缺乏安全感</div>\n      <div><strong>当前对主角的态度：</strong>认识但不熟，仅限于电梯或楼道碰面点头打招呼的普通邻居关系。</div>\n      <div class=\"pt-1\"><strong>外貌：</strong></div>\n      <div class=\"pl-3 space-y-0.5 text-[11px] text-gray-400\">\n        <div>• <strong>面容：</strong>标准的鹅蛋脸，皮肤白皙细腻，五官精致如画，尤其实一双桃花眼，眼尾微微上挑，自带三分朦胧懒意，但常被黑框眼镜遮挡，鼻梁高挺，嘴唇是天然的粉嫩水润。</div>\n        <div>• <strong>发型：</strong>及腰的黑色长发，通常随意地披散着或松松地挽起，发质极好，光线下有稠缎般的光泽。</div>\n        <div>• <strong>身高/体型：</strong>168cm，苗条匀称，骨架纤细。</div>\n        <div>• <strong>身材：</strong>腰肢纤细，盈盈一握；臀部挺翘圆润，弧线诱人；双腿笔直修长，比例极佳。</